Meta{format:TOON_v2.1.0,project:Request-Website-v2.0,document:REQUEST_AGENT_TASKS,updated:2026-02-08}:

Goal{summary}:
- Populate_Prismic_content_and_verify_previews

Inputs{required}:
- Prismic_repo:request
- CloudPreview:https://request-beryl.vercel.app/api/preview
- LocalPreview:http://localhost:3000/api/preview
- ContentSeed:docs/content-seed.md

Tasks{low_context}:
1) Create_Documents
   - site_settings(singleton)
   - page(uid=home)
   - imprint(singleton)
   - privacy_policy(singleton)

2) Upload_Media
   - hero_image_or_video
   - background_assets

3) Configure_Previews
   - Add local preview URL
   - Add cloud preview URL

4) Validate_Preview
   - Use Prismic Builder Preview button
   - Confirm redirect to app domain

5) Optional_Webhook
   - Add https://request-beryl.vercel.app/api/revalidate
   - Add header if PRISMIC_WEBHOOK_SECRET is set

Report{required}:
- Document IDs and URLs
- Preview status (local/cloud)
- Missing fields or model issues
